{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 57, :comments ["<b>To Gershon.</b> He began with the firstborn and mentioned his son, who is Libni, and did not mention Shimei. Perhaps he had no sons, or he had sons and they died without sons. Afterward he mentioned the Hebronite, who is a son of Kehat, and did not mention Uzziel. And afterward the sons of Merari, and he returned to mention the sons of Yitshar, and afterward the sons of Amram, and delayed them because he would explain what happened to the sons of the son of Amram."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:35.641624161Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}